# Always rule

## Policy

Never commit generated files under dist or build directories. When adding a dependency, explain the alternative you rejected in the PR. Prefer small, focused functions and name them after what they return. Public functions carry doc comments describing units and failure modes.

- API handlers validate input with the schema library and return typed errors.
- Database migrations must be reversible and reviewed by a second engineer.
